{
  "_comment": [
    "Everything the AR page knows about a card. Add a card by adding an",
    "entry here and dropping its compiled target in /ar/targets/<code>.mind.",
    "",
    "constellation.nodes  x and y are fractions of the card back, 0-1 from",
    "                     its top-left corner. Place them in /ar/calibrate.",
    "constellation.links  extra line pairs by name. Every node already links",
    "                     to the centre, so only the cross-links go here.",
    "story                the longer telling, shown as a sheet at the bottom",
    "                     of the phone once the card is recognised.",
    "scene                what stands up off the card in 3D: the story art",
    "                     in layers, and text placed in space. Arranged in",
    "                     /ar/studio.html — do not write this by hand.",
    "",
    "Scene units are card-widths. The card runs -0.5 to 0.5 across and",
    "-0.68 to 0.68 up; z is height above the card, towards the reader."
  ],
